<p>Chant the glory of the Moons, granting you stealth detection (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">+13, +18, +22, +25, +28</acronym> power), and invisibility detection (<acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">+13, +18, +22, +25, +28</acronym> power).</p><p>You may also attack creatures you cannot see without penalty and your critical hits do <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28%, 38%, 46%, 52%, 58%</acronym> more damage.</p><p>You may only have one Hymn active at once.</p><p>The stealth and invisibility detection will increase with your Spellpower.</p>